  "slug": "jens-fresh-and-spicy-salsa",
  "name": "Jen's Fresh and Spicy Salsa",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "This spicy salsa recipe is easy to make in a blender with fresh tomatoes, green onions, jalape\u00f1os, lime, and cilantro for a refreshing but fiery dip.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican Inspired Mexican",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Pulse tomatoes, green onions, jalape\u00f1o peppers, and cilantro in a blender or food processor to desired consistency. Transfer to a serving bowl. Mix in lime juice, hot pepper sauce, black pepper, garlic powder, and salt until well combined."
    }
  ],
